# A well-formed argument that never reaches the judgment rule: it concludes the
# intermediate `noted` (a valid agent-conclusion predicate) and never the
# contention, so the policy consumes nothing it derives.
ClaimA is grounded in a generation G1 if ClaimA comes from the generation and the generation was produced from a config C1 by an origin O1.
ClaimA notes a config C1 if ClaimA starts at the config.
